sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Beroz et al. (2018) Nature Physics & Hartmann et al. (2019) Nature Physics 3D rod-cell nematic verticalization and fountain flow in growing Vibrio cholerae biofilms — MorphoEval overall 93.7/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) evaluation of `2019-yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain.py` (overall weighted score: 93.8/100, up from 56.4/100 in v1). The remediated script relaxes a 2D circular Landau-de Gennes / Frank-Oseen nematic tilt free-energy functional via pseudo-spectral L-BFGS-B minimization coupled to 3D fountain-flow dome extrusion; validates the 7-point A22/WT/cephalexin cell-length sweep L in [1.4, 4.5] um (Pearson r = 0.9997, RMSE = 0.049 um, log-log exponent -0.5067 ± 0.0048 vs -0.50) and 8-point radial expansion trajectory R(t) in [6.0, 25.0] um (r = 1.0000, RMSE = 0.026 um); verifies all 5 genetic and pharmacological controls (WT rugose, Delta rbmA cohesion-loss flat monolayer, Delta bap1 Delta rbmC adhesion-loss flat monolayer, A22 short rods, and cephalexin long rods); and segments the SHA-256-locked Public Domain CDC PHIL specimen (`vibrio_cholerae_biofilm_specimen.jpg`, n = 73 rods, empirical aspect ratio L/d = 2.584 ± 0.764 vs WT 2.625). Overall 93.7/100 (faithfulness 93.6, reproducibility 94.1); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit e93f00e; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 95, Morphological realism / specimen match 92, Parameter expressivity 94, Morphometric validation 94, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 93, Reproducibility package 94. Output judged: docs/media/vibrio_biofilm_nematic_fountain_comparison.png: rendered output of 2019-yan-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain.py at e93f00e, image/png, 1177123 B, 2775×1680 px, artifact_sha256 80efda93e0c3882ec328cf498af02f1cdea57fadb6ad8c6fc92039fdefdc4e77 (sha256 80efda93e0c3882ec328cf498af02f1cdea57fadb6ad8c6fc92039fdefdc4e77), spec_fingerprint d831566c61695d418bb35d8095aa8c6100057ce72fecb5a3fc13843d4bcb5000. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: d831566c61695d418bb35d8095aa8c6100057ce72fecb5a3fc13843d4bcb5000; artifact_sha256: 80efda93e0c3882ec328cf498af02f1cdea57fadb6ad8c6fc92039fdefdc4e77; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/vibrio_biofilm_nematic_fountain/paper_citations.bib=25b7c5d98c7e6bdc..., datasets/vibrio_biofilm_nematic_fountain/scout_manifest.json=17aa91569cbce80c..., datasets/vibrio_biofilm_nematic_fountain/vibrio_biofilm_nematic_fountain_reference.json=2f8c3198aefc7de1..., datasets/vibrio_biofilm_nematic_fountain/vibrio_cholerae_biofilm_specimen.jpg=d21370a429873aae...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-vibrio-biofilm-nematic-fountain-audit." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Couple the 2D/axisymmetric Landau-de Gennes vertical tilt solver to a discrete 3D rod-element Hertzian contact simulation resolving individual cell-cell topological defects and polar peeling trajectories." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.937"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (MorphoEval Autonomous Loop Slot 095 Pass 2 Assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

